 "remarks": "Welcome to 21 Soundview Avenue, a fully renovated two-family offering an exceptional opportunity for owner-occupants and investors. The vacant first-floor unit features 3 bedrooms, 1.5 baths, a large eat-in kitchen, central air and in-unit laundry. The occupied second floor offers 2 bedrooms, 1 full bath, in-unit laundry and mini-split systems providing heating and cooling. Both units feature renovated kitchens and baths, new flooring and cabinetry, granite countertops and stainless-steel appliances. The roof has also been replaced. Owner-occupants can move right into the spacious first floor while rental income from the second floor helps offset monthly housing expenses. Outside, a rear parking area accommodates approximately 5 cars, while a large detached garage offers additional rental-income potential and separate dedicated storage space for each unit. Additional storage is available in the full basement. Ideally located less than a mile from the South Norwalk Metro-North station and minutes from SoNo's dining, shopping and waterfront, with Rowayton a short drive away. Convenient to I-95 and Route 1. A turnkey property combining modern living, income potential, ample parking and an outstanding location.",
